@startuml
actor Admin
participant FE
participant ContentSvc
database DB


Admin -> FE : Quản lý nội dung tĩnh
FE -> ContentSvc : listPages()
ContentSvc -> DB : SELECT pages
DB --> ContentSvc : rows
ContentSvc --> FE : list
opt Thêm/Sửa/Xóa
Admin -> FE : action(page)
FE -> ContentSvc : upsert/delete(page)
ContentSvc -> DB : INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE
DB --> ContentSvc : ok
ContentSvc --> FE : success
end
@enduml